<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in very heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 11.55 to 6,418.47.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.55 to 392.25.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 6 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,198 to 1,195.</p>
<p>Volume was 468,701,510, compared with 489,397,190 Wednesday.</p>
